{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "0d143556-6868-4181-ba31-ec5d8b7ef133",
      "name": "Application Transfers",
      "description": {
        "content": "An object representing a transfer request for an application between workspaces.\n\nThe high-level flow for application transfer:\n\n1. The initial workspace can create an application transfer. A single-use `code` will be generated which may be distributed to any end-user of Clerk.\n2. The code must be claimed through the clerk dashboard: https://dashboard.clerk.com/apps/transfer?code=<...>\n\nNote that once a transfer is claimed, the original workspace will no longer have access to the application.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
